sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PER002 as PER-002<br/>Business Owner
    participant PER050 as PER-050<br/>Relationship Manager
    participant PER056 as PER-056<br/>Credit Analyst
    participant SVC005 as SVC-005<br/>Commercial Banking Core<br/>(CAP-002)
    participant SVC102 as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant SVC012 as SVC-012<br/>Risk Engine<br/>(CAP-004)
    participant SVC009 as SVC-009<br/>Domestic Payments<br/>(CAP-003)
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053<br/>Notification Service

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over PER002,SVC005: PH-016: Loan Enquiry
        PER002->>PER050: Discusses requirements (purpose, amount, term, security)
        PER050->>SVC005: Reads BusinessCustomer (ENT-079) + BusinessAccount profile
        SVC005-->>PER050: Customer profile and existing facility data
        PER050->>PER002: Issues indicative terms letter (non-binding)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 220)
        Note over PER002,SVC053: PH-017: Loan Application
        PER002->>PER050: Submits formal application + financial statements + business plan
        PER050->>SVC005: POST /loan-applications<br/>{business_customer_id, requested_amount: 500000,<br/>term_months: 60, security_type: fixed_charge_property}
        SVC005->>SVC005: Creates ENT-017 (LoanApplication) status=submitted
        SVC005-)SVC102: EVT-031: LoanApplicationSubmitted<br/>topic: commercial.loan-applications
        SVC005-)SVC102: EVT-032: CreditAssessmentRequested<br/>topic: commercial.credit-assessments [CROSS-CAPABILITY ▶]
        SVC005-->>PER050: 201 Created {application_id, status: submitted}
        SVC102-)SVC053: Delivers EVT-031 → application acknowledgement to PER-002
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Note over SVC005,SVC012: PH-018: Credit Assessment (CAP-002/CAP-004 boundary — async only)
        SVC102-)SVC012: Delivers EVT-032 [◀ CROSS-CAPABILITY received by CAP-004]
        SVC012->>SVC012: Runs IRB PD/LGD/EAD/ECL models<br/>Creates ENT-018 (CreditAssessment)<br/>risk_rating=4, pd=0.0215, lgd=0.35, ead=500000, ecl=3762.50
        SVC012-)SVC102: EVT-033: CreditAssessmentCompleted<br/>topic: commercial.credit-assessments [CROSS-CAPABILITY ▶]
        SVC102-)SVC005: Delivers EVT-033 [◀ CROSS-CAPABILITY received by CAP-002]
        SVC005->>SVC005: Stores assessment_id reference<br/>Routes to Credit Analyst queue (risk_rating=4 → RM authority)
        SVC005->>PER056: Credit Analyst assigned — prepare credit paper
        PER056->>SVC012: Reads ENT-018 automated scores
        PER056->>PER056: Prepares credit paper: sector analysis, DSCR, security coverage, recommendation
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over PER050,SVC053: PH-019: Underwriting (within RM authority — no committee)
        PER050->>SVC005: Records approval decision<br/>committee_decision=approved (within RM authority)
        SVC005->>SVC005: Updates LoanApplication.status=approved
        SVC005-)SVC102: EVT-034: LoanApproved<br/>{approved_amount: 500000, decision: approved, risk_rating: 4}
        SVC102-)SVC053: Delivers EVT-034 → approval letter with APRC disclosure to PER-002
    end

    rect rgb(248, 230, 255)
        Note over PER002,SVC005: PH-020: Facility Agreement
        SVC005->>SVC005: Creates ENT-019 (FacilityAgreement)<br/>approved_amount=500000, rate={SONIA+280bps}<br/>covenants=[dscr_min:1.25, leverage_max:3.0]<br/>conditions_precedent=[debenture, personal_guarantee]
        PER050->>PER002: Issues facility agreement for review and signature
        PER002->>PER050: Executes agreement (ETDA e-signature)<br/>Provides debenture + personal guarantee
        PER050->>SVC005: Confirms all CPs satisfied — sets signed_date
        SVC005->>SVC005: FacilityAgreement.signed_date set<br/>all_conditions_precedent_satisfied=true<br/>LoanApplication.status=facility_agreed
        SVC005-)SVC102: EVT-036: FacilityAgreed<br/>{agreement_id, approved_amount: 500000, all_cps_satisfied: true}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        Note over PER002,SVC053: PH-021: Drawdown
        PER002->>SVC005: POST /loan-applications/{id}/drawdown<br/>{drawdown_instruction_id, drawdown_amount: 500000,<br/>destination_account_id, payment_rail: chaps}
        SVC005->>SVC005: Validates: FacilityAgreed ✓, all CPs ✓, amount ≤ facility ✓, CHAPS cut-off ✓
        SVC005->>SVC009: CHAPS payment instruction (sync) [CROSS-CAPABILITY ▶ CAP-003]<br/>Credit 500,000 to BusinessAccount (ENT-080)
        SVC009->>SVC009: Executes CHAPS via Bank of England RT2
        SVC009-->>SVC005: Settlement confirmed {settlement_reference}
        SVC005->>SVC005: Creates ENT-020 (LoanAccount)<br/>outstanding_balance=500000, status=active
        SVC005-)SVC102: EVT-037: LoanDrawnDown<br/>{account_id, drawdown_amount: 500000, outstanding_balance_after: 500000}
        SVC005-)SVC102: EVT-038: LoanAccountOpened<br/>{account_id, outstanding_balance: 500000, covenant_count: 2}
        SVC005-->>PER002: 200 OK {account_id, settlement_reference, first_payment_date}
        SVC102-)SVC012: Delivers EVT-037+EVT-038 [◀ CAP-004 updates RWA + IFRS 9 ECL register]
        SVC102-)SVC053: Delivers EVT-037 → drawdown confirmation letter to PER-002
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 245)
        Note over PER002,SVC005: PH-022: Ongoing Monitoring (first quarterly covenant test — all pass)
        SVC102-)SVC005: Delivers EVT-038 → activates covenant schedule<br/>Creates ENT-021 records (not_yet_tested)
        PER002->>SVC005: Submits Q1 financial statements for covenant testing
        SVC005->>SVC005: Calculates DSCR_actual=1.45 ≥ 1.25 ✓<br/>Leverage_actual=2.3 ≤ 3.0 ✓<br/>Updates ENT-021 compliance_status=compliant
        SVC005-)SVC053: Covenant compliance confirmation to PER-002
    end
